namespace pdg { /**

\fn pdg::Sprite::enableSpriterEvents(enable)

\ingroup Animation
\brief Enable or disable authored Spriter trigger notifications for this Sprite.

Register an IEventHandler for pdg::eventType_SpriteTriggerEvent to receive a
pdg::SpriteTriggerEvent payload. This flag does not gate blend-completion
notifications. See \ref animation_trigger_event for delivery and timing rules.

**/ }